{"version":1,"key":"card:446","content":{"id":446,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"clear","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 删除所有的字典项，原地执行，无返回值"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> d['name'] = 'Gumby'\n>>> d['age'] = 42\n>>> d\n{'age': 42, 'name': 'Gumby'}\n>>> returned_value = d.clear()\n>>> d\n{}\n>>> print(returned_value)\nNone","language":"py","uuid":"c9bea259-f37e-4ec5-9c7f-438d9295a8d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"copy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个新字典，其包含的键-值对与原来的字典相同（这个方法执行的是浅复制）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = {'username': 'admin', 'machines': ['foo', 'bar', 'baz']}\n>>> y = x.copy()\n>>> y['username'] = 'mlh'\n>>> y['machines'].remove('bar')\n>>> y\n{'username': 'mlh', 'machines': ['foo', 'baz']}\n>>> x\n{'username': 'admin', 'machines': ['foo', 'baz']}","language":"py","uuid":"86db3640-9925-4fba-b79c-fceb4d8e0452","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"深复制可使用模块 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"copy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"deepcopy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> from copy import deepcopy\n>>> d = {}\n>>> d['names'] = ['Alfred', 'Bertrand']\n>>> c = d.copy()\n>>> dc = deepcopy(d)\n>>> d['names'].append('Clive')\n>>> c\n{'names': ['Alfred', 'Bertrand', 'Clive']}\n>>> dc\n{'names': ['Alfred', 'Bertrand']}","language":"py","uuid":"5c78c7d8-1cc5-4bd7-afd7-a45042c601e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"fromkeys","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个新字典，其中包含指定的键，且每个键对应的值都是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> {}.fromkeys(['name', 'age'])\n{'age': None, 'name': None}","language":"py","uuid":"24695610-5206-4d86-8c33-069bea5cbf56","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不想使用默认值 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可提供特定的值。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> dict.fromkeys(['name', 'age'], '(unknown)')\n{'age': '(unknown)', 'name': '(unknown)'}","language":"py","uuid":"0f83d68c-f0e1-40c6-ba0d-45b26b32ae5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"get","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为访问字典项提供了宽松的环境。通常，如果你试图访问字典中没有的项，将引发错误。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> print(d['name'])\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\nKeyError: 'name'","language":"py","uuid":"71cf52d7-54e9-4d4e-8287-904c4547a241","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"get","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来访问不存在的键时，没有引发异常，而是返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。你可指定“默认”值，这样将返回你指定的值而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> print(d.get('name'))\nNone\n>>> d.get('name', 'N/A')\n'N/A'","language":"py","uuid":"8384f9cc-8ab0-4009-9d18-1e15b09e9efb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"items","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个包含所有字典项的列表，其中每个元素都为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"(key, value)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的形式。返回值属于一种名为字典视图的特殊类型。字典视图可用于迭代。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {'title': 'Python Web Site', 'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'spam': 0}\n>>> d.items()\ndict_items([('url', 'http://www.python.org'), ('spam', 0), ('title', 'Python Web Site')])\n\n>>> it = d.items()\n>>> len(it)\n3\n>>> ('spam', 0) in it\nTrue","language":"py","uuid":"bbb787fb-22cf-4b41-a63e-f11bb65d1113","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视图的一个优点是不复制，它们始终是底层字典的反映，即便你修改了底层字典亦如此。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"keys","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个字典视图，其中包含指定字典中的键。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {'x': 1, 'y': 2}\n>>> d.keys()\ndict_keys(['x', 'y'])","language":"py","uuid":"fd038f7f-f316-4eac-ab63-f0834de02871","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pop","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可用于获取与指定键相关联的值，并将该键-值对从字典中删除。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {'x': 1, 'y': 2}\n>>> d.pop('x')\n1\n>>> d\n{'y': 2}","language":"py","uuid":"73742cc2-e377-48c2-a520-58ffbdbfaf48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"popitem","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类似于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"list.pop","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"list.pop","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 弹出列表中的最后一个元素，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"popitem","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 随机地弹出一个字典项，因为字典项的顺序是不确定的，没有“最后一个元素”的概念。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你要以高效地方式"},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"逐个删除并处理所有字典项"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这可能很有用，因为这样无需先获取键列表。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'spam': 0, 'title': 'Python Web Site'}\n>>> d.popitem()\n('url', 'http://www.python.org')\n>>> d\n{'spam': 0, 'title': 'Python Web Site'}","language":"py","uuid":"4b9e4759-d133-4266-b513-1d6a57fadbaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"setdefault","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有点像 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"get","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为它也获取与指定键相关联的值，但除此之外，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"setdefault","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还在字典不包含指定的键时，在字典中添加指定的键-值对。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"指定的键不存在时，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"setdefault","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回指定的值并相应地更新字典。如果指定的键存在，就返回其值，并保持字典不变。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"get","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一样，值是可选的；如果没有指定，默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> d.setdefault('name', 'N/A')\n'N/A'\n>>> d\n{'name': 'N/A'}\n>>> d['name'] = 'Gumby'\n>>> d.setdefault('name', 'N/A')\n'Gumby'\n>>> d\n{'name': 'Gumby'}","language":"py","uuid":"1fc4252a-fc4b-40d2-bcf5-41a4dfbdba7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"update","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使用一个字典中的项来更新另一个字典。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {'title': 'Python Web Site', 'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'changed': 'Mar 14 22:09:15 MET 2016'}\n>>> x = {'title': 'Python Language Website'}\n>>> d.update(x)\n>>> d\n{'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'changed': 'Mar 14 22:09:15 MET 2016', 'title': 'Python Language Website'}","language":"py","uuid":"51da81cf-0667-4ff5-9d96-3f6b16da7595","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"values","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个由字典中的值组成的字典视图。不同于方法 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"keys","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，方法 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"values","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的视图"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可能包含重复的值"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> d[1] = 1\n>>> d[2] = 2\n>>> d[3] = 3\n>>> d[4] = 1\n>>> d.values()\ndict_values([1, 2, 3, 1])","language":"py","uuid":"5feda20a-06d8-4f3e-8a63-4b990f63c4f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/字典"],"createTime":1719155509796,"updateTime":1743303640440,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640440}}